706/creighton-coach-eastern-michigan-13-seasons","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Judge denies SEC's request for TRO against LSU in Dec. 3 vote","description":"A federal judge denied the SEC's request for a temporary restraining order to keep LSU from interfering with a Dec. 3 vote of presidents and chancellors on whether to remove the school from the conference.","published":"2026-11-25T20:02:54.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-sports/story/_/id/50595702/judge-denies-sec-request-tro-lsu-dec-3-vote","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Week 13 Game Day Kickoff: Nothing compares to the outright hatred of a rival","description":"What to expect in Rivalry Week, from top games and players to teams on upset alert.","published":"2026-11-25T19:44:59.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/gamedaykickoff112526/week-13-top-games-upsets-preview","type":"Story","byline":"David Hale","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Oklahoma State extends Morris with new 6-year deal","description":"Oklahoma State and head coach Eric Morris have agreed to a new six-year deal that will extend his contract through the 2032 season, sources told ESPN's Pete Thamel on Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T17:00:56.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50594432/sources-oklahoma-state-extends-morris-new-six-year-deal","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Where is 'College GameDay'? 2026 schedule, locations, recaps","description":"What is the \"College GameDay\" schedule? Find out more about where the program will be each week of the 2026 college football season.","published":"2026-11-25T15:16:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49783645/where-college-gameday-2026-schedule-locations-recaps","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top 25 betting lines: USC favored at UCLA, Texas double-digit faves at Texas A&M","description":"This week's odds and FPI predictions for UCLA-USC, Texas A&M-Texas and more.","published":"2026-11-25T15:00:51.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50571004/2026-college-football-week-13-top-25-betting-lines-odds","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Manuel to remain Michigan AD until new hire is found","description":"Warde Manuel has agreed to stay in the job as Michigan's athletic director until the school finds a new athletic director, sources told ESPN on Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T16:12:47.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50592920/sources-manuel-stay-job-new-michigan-ad-hired","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Pete Thamel and Dan Wetzel","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Bottom 10 after Week 12: How the Bruins put the 'L' in UCLA","description":"While UCLA suffered its first loss, we still have a team looking for its first win -- and time is running out.","published":"2026-11-25T12:14:25.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50585901/bottom-10-week-12-ucla","type":"Story","byline":"Ryan McGee","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5127738/ashton-hampton","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashton_Hampton"},"pick":{"pick":7,"round":1,"team":"TB","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Ashton Hampton","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashton_Hampton","description":"American football player (born 2006)","touched":"2026-11-22T23:50:22Z","intro":"Ashton Hampton (born January 9, 2006) is an American college football cornerback for the Clemson Tigers.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Hampton attended Florida State University High School in Tallahassee, Florida, where he played cornerback and wide receiver. He was the All-Big Bend Defensive Player of the Year his senior year after recording 64 tackles and three interceptions. During his career he had 92 tackles and six interceptions on defense and 115 receptions for 1,797 yards and 21 touchdowns as a receiver. Hampton committed to Clemson University to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Hampton earned immediate playing time his freshman year at Clemson in 2024. He started four of 14 games and had 30 tackles and two interception, one that was returned for a touchdown. He started all 13 games his sophomore year in 2025, recording 45 tackles and one interception."}]}}